<title>USA: GreenStone holders okay La.-Pacific merger.</title>
<headline>GreenStone holders okay La.-Pacific merger.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>GreenStone Industries Inc said Tuesday its stockholders had approved its previously announced merger into a wholly-owned subsidiary of Louisiana-Pacific Corp for $5.25 a share.</p>
<p>GreenStone said it expects the merger to be completed in the first week of January.</p>
</text>
